OL,3,GNEWSAInvitation for men to 'experience
OL,4,Ahot flushes'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPartners of women going through the
OL,7,Fmenopause are being invited to
OL,8,Fexperience one of the symptoms at a
OL,9,Fforthcoming support event.
OL,11,FAt the Menopaus'ull Support Network
OL,12,Fevent in Hull next month, health group
OL,13,FOver The Bloody Moon will be taking one
OL,14,Fof its MenoVests, allowing people to
OL,15,Fexperience a hot flush ` one of the
OL,16,Fsymptoms of the menopause.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,384,380,200,160,0,100
