OL,3,GNEWSAInvitation for men to 'experience
OL,4,Ahot flushes'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSarah Weichardt, who co-manages the
OL,7,Fproject, said: "We're particularly
OL,8,Finterested in getting men along to come
OL,9,Fand experience the MenoVest, just so
OL,10,Fthat they can understand what women go
OL,11,Fthrough."
OL,13,FThe event will be at Princes Quay
OL,14,Fshopping centre on 17 October, from
OL,15,F10:30 until 14:30 BST.
